        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Excuse me, I came to hand in
my club form. Is
Suzuki-sensei from the
tennis club...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Teacher</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Suzuki-sensei's out on a
work trip today. Why not
take it to the tennis club
yourself？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I see. Okay then...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Huh... These are pretty
nice tennis courts...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Huh？ ...Why isn't anyone
practicing after school？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Oh, there's someone！)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, excuse me！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes, can I help you with
something？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Whoa... She's pretty...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, is there something...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, right. I'm ▲苗字▲
▲名前▲, a second-year. I
just transferred in, and I
want to join today. I
brought my form, but...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Then you must be the new
member Suzuki-sensei
mentioned...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Probably me.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm Manaka Takane, a
second-year in the girls'
tennis club.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Same year, then. Nice to
meet you！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>By the way... is practice
off today？ It looks like
it's just you,
▲高嶺＊＊▲...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Today's special. The boys'
and girls' teams have a
get-together, so everyone's
gone.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I see. I brought my form,
but if nobody's here...
Huh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Don't you have to go,
▲高嶺＊＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm... sort of watching the
place.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Should I hold on to your
form？ I can give it to the
captain.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But aren't you in the middle
of practice？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's fine. We all need a
hand sometimes. Right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(▲高嶺＊＊▲, huh...
My new life's off to a good
start！)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
      </SDL2>
