          <Dialog>Sorry, when you've already
got the tea to deal with...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We all need a hand
sometimes. Right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Then I'll help with the tea.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, thanks. Shall we go,
then？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(▲高嶺＊＊▲, huh...
My new life's off to a good
start！)</Dialog>
